sequenceDiagram
  actor user as "User<br/>[Person]"
  box rgba(17,104,189,0.12) Banking System (Software System boundary)
    participant api as "Withdrawal API<br/>[Container: Spring Boot]"
    participant db as "Account Database<br/>[Container: PostgreSQL]"
  end
  user->>api: Requests a withdrawal
  api->>db: Reads current balance
  db-->>api: Returns current balance
  alt Sufficient funds
    api->>db: Reduces balance by amount
    db-->>api: Confirms balance updated
    api-->>user: Returns withdrawal confirmation
  else Insufficient funds
    api-->>user: Rejects withdrawal request
  end
